---
apiVersion: kuttl.dev/v1beta1
kind: TestStep
timeout: 300
---
# Feature 2: standing reconciliation. The per-cluster kafka-agent reconciles a KafkaTopic against the
# live cluster over the pure-Rust `kafka_client` (Metadata/CreateTopics, mTLS from the granted cert) —
# no rdkafka, no JVM. `replicationFactor: 2` needs >=2 brokers, so this runs after the scale-UP (step 30).
apiVersion: kafka.stackable.tech/v1alpha1
kind: KafkaTopic
metadata:
  name: test-topic
spec:
  clusterRef:
    name: test-kafka
  topicName: test-topic
  partitions: 6
  replicationFactor: 2
  config:
    retention.ms: "600000"
